`reg 45(10E) the entries listed` MEANS LIST
      `reg 45(10E)(a) the individual's country of residence`
    , `reg 45(10E)(b) the individual's nationality`
    , `reg 45(10E)(c) the nature and extent of the individual's beneficial interest`

-- reg 45(10E): the further information about each individual beneficial owner that the trustees give the Commissioners.
@ref reg 45(10E) (src:1473-1477)
GIVEN item IS A `reg 45(10E) item`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
