    CONSIDER item
    WHEN `reg 45(10E)(a) the individual's country of residence` THEN JUST TRUE -- listed: "The trustees must provide the Commissioners with the following information"
    WHEN `reg 45(10E)(b) the individual's nationality` THEN JUST TRUE -- listed: "The trustees must provide the Commissioners with the following information"
    WHEN `reg 45(10E)(c) the nature and extent of the individual's beneficial interest` THEN JUST TRUE -- listed: "The trustees must provide the Commissioners with the following information"
    WHEN `reg 45(10E) another item` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): the paragraph lists the information and does not say that nothing else is required

@ref reg 45(10E) (src:1473-1477)
GIVEN item IS A `reg 45(10E) item`
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`reg 45(10E) the wording of the entry` MEANS
