    THEN JUST "a description of the class of persons who are beneficiaries or potential beneficiaries under the trust"
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): a description cannot carry JUST FALSE; the "where" that fails is answered no by the yes/no function below

-- The yes/no twin of the function above: is the information to be provided under (10E) the description of the class?
-- src:1478 | (10F) Where the beneficial owners include a class of beneficiaries, not all of whom have been determined, the information to be provided under paragraph (10E) is a description of the class of persons who are beneficiaries or potential beneficiaries under the trust.
