    WHEN `reg 45(10G)(a)(iii) the registered or principal office of the third country entity` THEN JUST TRUE -- listed: "provide the Commissioners with the following information"
    WHEN `reg 45(10G)(a) another item` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): the sub-paragraph lists the information and does not say that nothing else is required

